@startsalt
' Screen: OTel Settings — Sampling Configuration
' User Stories:
'   - US-314: As an admin, I can set head-sampling rate to control ingestion volume
'   - US-315: As an admin, I can configure tail-sampling rules to ensure important traces are always kept
'   - US-316: As an admin, I understand propagation delay implications before saving

{
  <b>CodeFre.sh</b> | Settings | Observability | <b>Sampling</b>
  ==
  {/ <b>Retention</b> | <b>Sampling</b> | <b>Exporters</b> | <b>Index Settings</b> }
  ==
  {
    <b>Sampling Configuration</b>
    <i>Control which traces are collected and stored. Changes take effect within 60 seconds.</i>
    ==
    <b>Head Sampling (Probabilistic)</b>
    <i>Applied at trace creation — before the trace completes. Reduces collection overhead.</i>
    --
    {
      <b>Sample Rate</b>
      --
      "0.50" | [────────────●─────────────────────────────] | <i>50%</i>
      <i>Range: 0.00 (none) to 1.00 (all). Current: collect 1 in 2 traces.</i>
    }
    ==
    <b>Tail Sampling Rules</b>
    <i>Applied after trace completion — override head sampling for specific trace patterns.</i>
    <i>Rules are evaluated in order. First match wins.</i>
    --
    {#
      <b>#</b> | <b>Condition</b>                      | <b>Action</b>      | <b>Priority</b> | <b>Enabled</b>
      1  | status = error                   | Always keep   | High        | (X) On  ( ) Off
      2  | run_linked = true                | Always keep   | High        | (X) On  ( ) Off
      3  | latency_ms > 5000               | Always keep   | Medium      | (X) On  ( ) Off
      4  | (all other traces)              | Drop          | Default     | —
    }
    --
    [+ Add Tail Rule]
    ==
    {
      <b>ℹ Propagation Delay Note</b>
      --
      Tail-sampling decisions are made <b>after</b> all spans in a trace are received.
      The collector waits up to <b>30 seconds</b> before finalizing the sampling decision.
      Spans arriving after this window may be stored regardless of rules.
      --
      <b>Collector wait window:</b> ^30 seconds^
    }
    ==
    {
      [Cancel] | [Save Sampling Config]
    }
  }
}
@endsalt
